<title>USA: Noland says Nov sales fall 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Noland says Nov sales fall 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noland Co said on Monday that November sales fell 2.7 percent to $36 million from November 1995's $37 million.</p>
<p>Through the first 11 months of 1996, the wholesale distributor posted sales of $433.3 million, slightly less than $434.1 million in the comparable period last year, Noland said.</p>
